          <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
            <name>RecordCostDecreaseByReversal</name>
            <id>78</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Decrease is recorded by reversing expenses</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>کاهش با برگشت هزینه‌ها ثبت می‌شود</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Уменьшение отражается путем сторнирования расходов</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Düşüş giderlerin tersine çevrilmesiyle yansıtılır</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Thao tác ghi giảm được phản ánh bằng cách đảo ngược chi phí</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Decrease is recorded by reversing expenses</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Decrease is recorded by reversing expenses</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
            <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
              <segments>RecordCostDecreaseByReversal</segments>
            </dataPath>
            <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
            <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
            <extendedTooltip>
              <name>RecordCostDecreaseByReversalExtendedTooltip</name>
              <id>80</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>For example, it can be used to reduce cost if the document related to intangible asset purchase was reversed.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>برای مثال، می‌تواند برای کاهش بهای تمام‌شده در صورتی استفاده شود که سند مرتبط با خرید دارایی نامشهود برگشت داده شده باشد.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>Например, может использоваться для уменьшения стоимости, если был сторнирован документ, связанный с приобретением нематериального актива.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Örneğin, bir maddi olmayan duran varlığın edinimi ile ilgili bir belgenin iptal edilmesi durumunda maliyetin düşürülmesi için kullanılabilir.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Ví dụ: có thể sử dụng để giảm giá trị, nếu đảo ngược chứng từ liên quan đến việc mua sắm tài sản cố định vô hình.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>For example, it can be used to reduce cost if the document related to intangible asset purchase was reversed.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>For example, it can be used to reduce cost if the document related to intangible asset purchase was reversed.</value>
              </title>
              <type>Label</type>
              <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
              <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
              <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
                <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
              </extInfo>
            </extendedTooltip>
            <contextMenu>
              <name>RecordCostDecreaseByReversalContextMenu</name>
              <id>79</id>
              <autoFill>true</autoFill>
            </contextMenu>
            <type>CheckBoxField</type>
            <editMode>Enter</editMode>
            <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
            <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
            <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:CheckBoxFieldExtInfo"/>
